  "content": "\n\n![https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png)\n\n## 簡介：\n\n此模組為您的終界維度增添了多種建築與迷宮，豐富您的探索體驗。這些迷宮內建怪物生成器與裝滿戰利品的箱子，提供資源及與環境互動的機會。\n\n- 喚魔者城堡\n- 困難城堡\n- 高塔\n- 宮殿\n- 金字塔   \n\n## 探索更多精彩模組！\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-village\"\n  title=\"下載 Better Villages - 改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Better Villages - 增強與改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dGVX5JbJ/37fb0191b7d0da4db6440b5ceb705e3eea0e6e35_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon - 探索 Minecraft 中的史詩級迷宮\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Awesome Dungeon - 全新結構與充滿戰利品的迷宮\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ptzsjBKT/ab4804bc31f91f53a5ffadc52162f1ab4c967cb5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-nether\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon：下界版 - 危險的下界迷宮\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon 下界版 - 在致命的下界迷宮中求生\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gW1httFP/2b963bb4be8659f1f3492100aa9c48066ab699f0_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon：海洋版 - 海底迷宮冒險\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon 海洋版 - 發現沉沒的迷宮與寶藏\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hn56Bq5n/0b21eff420e6c04c3820efebd77ab9bf2ee82d76_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/disable-new-world-creation-screen\"\n  title=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 找回經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 找回經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hpXiq9nb/6eb794a665a467ed7307803da1e26a1316f6a0e5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n\n喜歡這個模組嗎？別錯過未來的更新！點擊專案頁面的「追蹤」